  "bio": "Specializing in the vivid and contemporary 'newschool' alongside the timeless 'black & gray' styles, Ryan Miracle is renowned for his exceptional professionalism in Eagle Butte, United States. With a keen eye for detail, and a strict adherence to industry standards, clients can expect a high level of cleanliness at every stage of the tattooing process, ensuring not only stunning artwork but also a safe and hygienic experience. Reach out to Ryan to book a session where both art and well-being are taken seriously.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Eagle Butte, South Dakota, United States"
